{title: Deck the Halls}
{subtitle: Melodia gallese "Nos Galan", testo T. Oliphant (1862) - pubblico dominio}
{key: D}
# Testo e accordi: https://github.com/cardinote/christmas-chords-lyrics (src/Deck-the-Halls.txt, MIT)
# Testo confrontato con: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Deck_the_Halls
